{"translation":{"id":"ory_irv","name":"ଇଣ୍ଡିୟାନ ରିୱାଇସ୍ଡ୍ ୱରସନ୍ ଓଡିଆ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=ory","shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Oriya Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"ory","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"3b125b700139f03689128054e637c9a878e3e4db50668657b003064bae8eea16","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","languageEnglishName":"Odia"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"ory_irv","name":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","commonName":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","title":"ଗୀତସଂହିତା","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"f9637b7ce36ccb546967f4d7b513179d1d4628ce44a28d7987e354c3237ad3af","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/1.json","firstChapterReference":{"translationId":"ory_irv","book":"PSA","chapter":1},"lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/150.json","lastChapterReference":{"translationId":"ory_irv","book":"PSA","chapter":150},"totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ପ୍ରଭାତକାଳୀନ ପ୍ରାର୍ଥନା"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ଦାଉଦଙ୍କର ଆପଣା ପୁତ୍ର ଅବଶାଲୋମ ନିକଟରୁ ପଳାୟନକାଳୀନ ଗୀତ।"]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ହେ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୋ, ମୋହର ବିପକ୍ଷମାନେ କିପରି ବଢ଼ିଅଛନ୍ତି।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ମୋʼ ବିରୁଦ୍ଧରେ ଉତ୍ଥିତ ଲୋକ ଅନେକ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"ଅନେକେ ମୋʼ ପ୍ରାଣ ବିଷୟରେ କହନ୍ତି, ପରମେଶ୍ୱରଙ୍କ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ନିକଟରେ ତାହା ପାଇଁ ପରିତ୍ରାଣ","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"ନାହିଁ। [ସେଲା]","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"ମାତ୍ର ହେ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୋ, ତୁମ୍ଭେ ମୋʼ ଚତୁର୍ଦ୍ଦିଗରେ ଢାଲ ସ୍ୱରୂପ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ମୋହର ଗୌରବ ଓ ମୋʼ ମସ୍ତକ ଉଠାଇବା କର୍ତ୍ତା ଅଟ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"ମୁଁ ଆପଣା ରବରେ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁଙ୍କୁ ଡାକେ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ପୁଣି, ସେ ଆପଣା ପବିତ୍ର ପର୍ବତରୁ ମୋତେ ଉତ୍ତର ଦିଅନ୍ତି। [ସେଲା]","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"ମୁଁ ଶୟନ କରି ନିଦ୍ରାଗତ ହେଲି; ମୁଁ ଜାଗ୍ରତ ହେଲି;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"କାରଣ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁ ମୋତେ ରକ୍ଷା କରନ୍ତି।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"ମୁଁ ଆପଣା ପ୍ରତିକୂଳରେ ପରିବେଷ୍ଟିତ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଅୟୁତ ଅୟୁତ ଲୋକଙ୍କୁ ଭୟ କରିବି ନାହିଁ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ହେ ସଦାପ୍ରଭୋ, ଉଠ; ହେ ମୋହର ପରମେଶ୍ୱର, ମୋତେ ପରିତ୍ରାଣ କର।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"କାରଣ ତୁମ୍ଭେ ମୋହର ଶତ୍ରୁ ସମସ୍ତଙ୍କ କଳହାଡ଼ରେ ଆଘାତ କରିଅଛ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ତୁମ୍ଭେ ଦୁଷ୍ଟମାନଙ୍କ ଦନ୍ତ ଭାଙ୍ଗି ପକାଇଅଛ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ପରିତ୍ରାଣ","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"ସଦାପ୍ରଭୁଙ୍କର ଅଧିକାର;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ତୁମ୍ଭ ଲୋକମାନଙ୍କ ଉପରେ ତୁମ୍ଭର ଆଶୀର୍ବାଦ ବର୍ତ୍ତୁ। [ସେଲା]","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"ପରିତ୍ରାଣ କିମ୍ବା ସାହାଯ୍ୟ","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":2}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"ପରିତ୍ରାଣ କିମ୍ବା ବିଜୟ","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/3.json","thisChapterReference":{"translationId":"ory_irv","book":"PSA","chapter":3},"thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/4.json","nextChapterReference":{"translationId":"ory_irv","book":"PSA","chapter":4},"nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/2.json","previousChapterReference":{"translationId":"ory_irv","book":"PSA","chapter":2},"previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"thisChapterAudioTimings":{},"nextChapterAudioTimings":{},"previousChapterAudioTimings":{},"numberOfVerses":8,"simpleChapterApiLink"